## Tools

Run `<service> <tool> '<JSON object>'`. Omit the object for tools with no arguments. Use `<service> <tool> --help` for the JSON schema.

Example: `math-server add '{"a":2,"b":3}'`.

A command can exit 0 even when the service reports a failure. If the response includes `status` and `output`, check both before continuing.

