- `light-news list-all-sections`: Retrieve a list of all available news sections (categories) in LightNews, such as 'World', 'Technology', 'Sports', etc. A dictionary containing status and output. On success, output is a list of section names; on failure, output contains an error message.
- `light-news get-last-k-news`: Fetch the most recent K news articles from a specific section in LightNews. A dictionary containing status and output. On success, output is a list of news articles (including title, summary, publish time, and NID); on failure, output contains an error message. JSON keys: section, k.
- `light-news search`: Search for news articles in a specific section using keywords, with optional date range filtering. A dictionary containing status and output. On success, output is a list of matching news articles (with NID, title, snippet, and publish date); on failure, output contains an error message. JSON keys: section, query, maxn, begin_date, end_date.
- `light-news get-details`: Retrieve the full content and metadata of a specific news article in LightNews using its unique ID. A dictionary containing status and output. On success, output includes the article's title, full body text, author, publish time, section, and associated media; on failure (e.g., invalid or non-existent NID), output contains an error message. JSON keys: nid.
- `light-news get-news-url`: Retrieve the shareable URL for a specific news article in LightNews using its unique ID. A dictionary containing status and output. On success, output is the full URL string to the news article; on failure (e.g., invalid NID), output contains an error message. JSON keys: nid.
